   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">What platform and browser are you using -- and where are you seeing the characters come out incorrect?<div><br></div><div>When I run it (Mac OS X 10.9, Chrome, Shiny 0.8.0), the values appear correct. Here&#39;s the code I&#39;m using:</div>\r\n\r\n<div><div><br></div><div>options(shiny.trace = TRUE) # Print debugging info to console</div><div>runApp(list(</div><div>  ui = pageWithSidebar(</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>    headerPanel(&quot;Test input characters&quot;),</div><div>    sidebarPanel(</div>\r\n\r\n<div>      textInput(&quot;char&quot;, &quot;Write character&quot;, &quot;&quot;)</div><div>    ),</div><div>    mainPanel()</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
